//
// The lock screen (design artifacts: lock screen) — the greeter's one page: the lock layer
// (`LockLayer`: the clock at the top, the selected user with the password capsule in the middle,
// the other users and the power buttons at the bottom, on the wallpaper with its tint) at the
// artifact's insets for the size class. Authority stays in sessiond: the page
// asks through `SessionStore` (`ui/composables/session.store.nx`) and shows the answer.
//
// The desktop band, full screen, never resized: the greeter is the session's first surface.
Window {
    style: plain,
    mode: auto,
    level: desktop,
    resizable: false,
}

Page GreeterPage {
    Stack {
        if device.sizeClass == "compact" {
            LockLayer { insetY: 32, insetX: 16 }
        } else {
            LockLayer { insetY: 48, insetX: 48 }
        }
    }
    .bgFade(transparent, scrim)
}
